{
  "about": [
    "The pack's boss roster: ONE entry per entity type, read by every script that asks about bosses",
    "(kubejs/server_scripts/0_lib_registry.js -> icraft.bosses) and by the dev tools (dev/rosters).",
    "How to add a boss, what each key means and which script reads it: dev/rosters/README.md.",
    "After any edit: python .minecraft/dev/rosters/validate.py  (the pre-push hook runs it).",
    "tier 1-4. kind: named = trophy boss (first-kill + repeat tokens), miniboss = tokens on every kill,",
    "unlisted = on neither kill roster. hp = designed health. levelHp = the designed health of a Progressive Bosses",
    "level of the entity ({ \"3\": 1000 }: level 3; a level not listed takes hp). rush = the boss-rush roster (tier) it counts for.",
    "flags: boss (core.isBoss + kept out of the mob-tier health), x3 (global boss buff), perKill (per-kill scaling,",
    "switched off below), witchInk (+10 Witch of Ink counter), abyssBoss, vorpalMelee / vorpalArcane (the two",
    "decapitation blocklists), caster (the five spellcasters the spawn scripts must not touch).",
    "The ORDER of the entries is the order scripts iterate them (the arena table most of all): add next to related entries.",
    "Strict JSON, no comments. Every id must be a registered entity type, or carry `absent` with the reason it is kept."
  ],
  "schema": 1,
  "switches": {
    "perKill": { "on": true, "why": "ON since 2026-10-15, per player (ruling 23, 2026-10-14; the design answered by the operator 2026-10-15): the highest count among the players within 64 blocks fixes a flagged boss at its first exchange with a player; every player within 64 blocks is credited a kill. scaling/boss_progressive.js. The Wither is not flagged (ruled out). Off = no boss is scaled and no kill is counted." }
  },
